{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04938","headline":"仪坤庙乐章二首 二 · 薛稷","name":"仪坤庙乐章二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乾道既亨，坤元以贞。\n肃雍攸在，辅佐斯成。\n外睦九族，内光一庭。\n克生睿哲，祚我休明。\n钦若徽范，悠哉淑灵。\n建兹清宫，於彼上京。\n缩茅以献，絜秬惟馨。\n实受其福，斯乎亿龄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛稷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}